<speech id="uk.org.publicwhip/westminhall/2017-07-18a.285.4" speakername="Matthew Pennycook" person_id="uk.org.publicwhip/person/25379" colnum="285" time="16:30:00" url="">
    <p pid="a285.4/1">Does my hon. Friend agree that one of the elements of this case that the family cannot understand is why the Foreign Secretary and the former Foreign Secretary have not taken the time to meet Richard and the family? No Ministers have, either, but surely the Foreign Secretary can give a case of this seriousness some of his personal time.</p>
</speech>
